.Sh ADDITIONAL C PORTS
Bounded Toybox 0.8.15 adaptations provide
.Xr diff 1
for comparing two regular files and
.Xr hexdump 1
for conventional byte displays. Their pages define supported options and
refusals; see
.Xr toybox 7
for source and license information.
.Pp
The native uncompressed archive interface is documented in
.Xr tar 1 .
Its supported format and native metadata limits are described there.
The pinned sbase ports also provide
.Xr tr 1
for character translation, deletion and squeezing, and
.Xr dirname 1
for extracting a directory component without opening the path.
.Xr tee 1
copies a stream to files while retaining standard output, and
.Xr sleep 1
delays a script for a whole number of seconds.
Guest qualification of this pipeline successor remains pending.
